          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kahi ya seemu za mbari ya Rubini ahewa midzi hino: Bezeri phamwenga na weruwe wa kurisa, Jahaza phamwenga na weruwe wa kurisa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedemothi phamwenga na weruwe wa kurisa na Mefaathi phamwenga na weruwe wa kurisa. Jumula ni midzi mine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kahi ya seemu ya mbari ya Gadi ahewa midzi hino: Ramothi urio Giliadi phamwenga na weruwe wa kurisa Ramothi ni mudzi wa kuchimbirira kpwa mutu achiyeolaga, Mahanaimu phamwenga na weruwe wa kurisa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heshiboni phamwenga na weruwe wa kurisa na Jazeri phamwenga na weruwe wa kurisa. Jumula ni midzi mine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Midzi hino yosi yahewa atu a chivyazi cha Merari kulengana na miryango yao. Hano ndio Alawi ariokala akasala nao ahewa midzi kumi na miiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
