          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya Mwenyezi Mlungu achiapha amani chila uphande kama arivyoapira akare ao. Takuna hata adui mmwenga ariyeweza kuashinda, mana Mwenyezi Mlungu waapha nguvu za kushinda maadui gao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
